# Living PMO (mandatory)

The folder `project-management/` is the Single Source of Truth for planning and status.

Whenever you complete, start, cancel, or re-scope meaningful work:

1. Update the matching task in `project-management/exports/tasks.json` (`status`, `progress`, `notes`).
2. Reflect checkboxes in `PROJECT_STATUS.md`, the active `SPRINT_XX.md`, and the relevant `*_PROGRESS.md`.
3. Append to `CHANGELOG.md` and, when done, `DONE.md` with task ID + PR link.
4. If you discover debt/risk/blocker: update `TECH_DEBT.md` / `RISKS.md` / `BLOCKERS.md`.
5. Never ship a feature without a PMO touch in the same PR when the change maps to a tracked task.

Before large new work: read `EXECUTIVE_SUMMARY.md` and confirm priority against the 31 Shahrivar checkpoint (mid-tail SEO + UX + CWV — not head-term #1 vanity).
